  "name": "Mythic+ keystone bricks when its owner leaves the group (#7354)",
  "contract": [
    "#7354: leaving the party during a keystone run used to brick the key, stop the timer and downgrade",
    "it; the run kept going instead. When the keystone's owner leaves the group the run stops (state 2, no more timer",
    "updates) and the key stays at the level it lost at the start."
